title: BrainCell
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Savtchenko
    given-names: Leonid P.
    affiliation: >-
      Rusakov Lab, UCL Queen Square Institute of Neurology, University College
      London, London, United Kingdom
  - family-names: Rusakov
    given-names: Dmitri A.
    affiliation: >-
      Rusakov Lab, UCL Queen Square Institute of Neurology, University College
      London, London, United Kingdom
repository-code: https://github.com/RusakovLab/BRAINCELL
url: https://github.com/RusakovLab/BRAINCELL
abstract: >-
  BrainCell is a NEURON-based platform for modelling neurons, astrocytes and
  extracellular dynamics at nanoscale resolution, with a GUI-driven workflow
  for geometry, biophysics presets, simulation and model export.
keywords:
  - computational neuroscience
  - NEURON
  - astrocyte
  - synapse
  - extracellular diffusion
  - nanoscale morphology
